om/python/mypy/issues/4069#issuecomment-334853466","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/4069","id":334853466,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMzNDg1MzQ2Ng==","user":{"login":"emmatyping","id":9504279,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MDQyNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9504279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping","html_url":"https://github.com/emmatyping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-10-06T19:50:45Z","updated_at":"2017-10-06T19:50:45Z","body":"Confirmed on master, I am stepping through now. I appears the issue only occurs in the second pass of the checker (the class is added to the scope stack in the first pass, but not in the second).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/334853466/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"emmatyping","id":9504279,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MDQyNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9504279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping","html_url":"https://github.com/emmatyping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/334865087","html_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/4069#issuecomment-334865087","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/4069","id":334865087,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDMzNDg2NTA4Nw==","user":{"login":"emmatyping","id":9504279,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MDQyNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9504279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping","html_url":"https://github.com/emmatyping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-10-06T20:43:17Z","updated_at":"2017-10-06T20:43:17Z","body":"It appears that when we defer functions to the second pass, we [try to put the class context information](https://github.com/python/mypy/blob/master/mypy/checker.py#L270). However, the function `node` is not removed on L261, so the class is not resolved, and that returns `None`. This later causes issues when we try to append the class context, but cannot, so the `__getattr__` method appears to be in the file context (this occurs in `check_second_pass`). The `__getattr__` checking for module levels if the first thing that relied on the size of the scope being 1 (module level), so it exposed this issue.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/334865087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"emmatyping","id":9504279,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1MDQyNzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9504279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping","html_url":"https://github.com/emmatyping","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/emmatyping/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/comments/334881298","html_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy/issues/4069#issuecomment-334881298","iss